# /etc/inittab - yi-hack-v6 (BusyBox init)
#
# Replaces the stock inittab, whose only difference was an AUTO-LOGIN ROOT
# getty on the serial console (ttyS000). Reaching the UART pads requires
# disassembling the camera, recovery goes through SSH / telnet / the rescue
# web UI (and ultimately the SD reflash), and boot diagnostics are captured
# to /dev/yi-boot.log and dmesg - so the serial console added no value and
# skipped the root password. No getty is started.

::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS

# Stuff to do when restarting the init process
::restart:/sbin/init

# Stuff to do before rebooting
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/bin/umount -a -r
::shutdown:/sbin/swapoff -a
